{
  "about": "What the QA kit relies on in every Max Architecture app (SG CLI 'sg init' boilerplate) and in our SDD specs. 'quote' must appear at boilerplate_file:boilerplate_line; 'pattern' is searched in an app's app_file. Single source for MAX_CONTRACT.md and check_max.py.",
